<h1 data-copy-en="Terra" data-copy-zh="Terra">Terra</h1>
<p class="starter-description" data-copy-en="Research visits, relationship milestones, an Army invitation and a living gift." data-copy-zh="研究会面、关系进展、军团邀请与活体礼物。">Research visits, relationship milestones, an Army invitation and a living gift.</p>
<div class="wiki-source-line"><span data-copy-en="v1.0_BETAx · Updated 9 November 2026" data-copy-zh="v1.0_BETAx · 2026 年 11 月 9 日更新">v1.0_BETAx · Updated 9 November 2026</span></div></div></section>
<section class="section wiki-reading-section"><div class="container wiki-reading-layout">
<aside class="wiki-toc"><div class="wiki-toc-inner"><button aria-expanded="false" class="wiki-toc-toggle" data-wiki-toc-toggle="" type="button"><span data-copy-en="On this page" data-copy-zh="本页目录">On this page</span><span aria-hidden="true">+</span></button><p class="wiki-toc-heading" data-copy-en="On this page" data-copy-zh="本页目录">On this page</p><div class="wiki-toc-links" data-lang-panel="en" data-wiki-toc-links=""><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-overview">Overview</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-location">Where to find them</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-route">Route and relationship milestones</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-activities">Activities and rewards</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-troubleshooting">What usually blocks the next step</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-related">Related guides</a></div><div class="wiki-toc-links" data-lang-panel="zh" data-wiki-toc-links="" hidden="" lang="zh-CN"><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-overview">概览</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-location">去哪里找</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-route">路线与关系进展</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-activities">行动与奖励</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-troubleshooting">卡住时检查什么</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-related">相关指南</a></div></div></aside>
<article class="wiki-article"><div class="wiki-source-content wiki-source-content-en" data-lang-panel="en" lang="en"><section id="en-overview"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Overview"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Quick_Stats_and_Availability"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Recommended_Progression"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Heart-to-Heart_Requirements_and_Answers"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="The_Seed_She_Named"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Beauty_Without_a_Metric"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="After_the_Survey"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Optional_Higher-Point_Answers"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Optional_Dates"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Skygarden_Best_Replies"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Memory_Arcade_Best_Replies"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Help_Defend_the_Fortress"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="A_Familiar_Scent_and_Willow's_Medicine_Research"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="A_Familiar_Scent_and_Willow.27s_Medicine_Research"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Credits_and_Current_Scope"></span><h2>Overview</h2><figure class="reviewed-screenshot" style="max-width: 256px"><a aria-label="View full screenshot: Terra — character portrait." href="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/terra.webp" rel="noopener" target="_blank"><img alt="Terra — character portrait." decoding="async" height="175" loading="lazy" src="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/terra.webp" width="175"/></a><figcaption>Terra — character portrait.</figcaption></figure><p>Terra’s route alternates botanical research visits with three conversations. Her two dates, Army invitation and one-time living gift have their own requirements.</p></section>
<section id="en-location"><h2>Where to find them</h2><p>Her portrait is at Genetically Enhanced Plant Research Dome, daily 06:00–17:59. Some later automatic scenes instead begin at the waste-processing site or archive; check the table for each start.</p></section>
<section id="en-route"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Automatic_Personal_Route"></span><h2>Route and relationship milestones</h2><p>Visit for Unnatural Selection, then follow the scene chain below. The third conversation, After the Survey, is required before the later archive visit. That visit also needs archive record 6 completed.</p><p>The First Unmeasured Plot needs Story 35, Intimate (1,600), the preceding archive visit and both Terra and Ghost home from vacation. It does not require reaching In Love first.</p><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Automatic scene</th><th scope="col">Location / start window</th><th scope="col">Requirements</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Unnatural Selection</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Genetically Enhanced Plant Research Dome; 06:00–17:59</td><td data-label="Requirements"></td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Forty Percent More</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Genetically Enhanced Plant Research Dome; 06:00–17:59</td><td data-label="Requirements">Acknowledged (10); after Unnatural Selection</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Genetic Reference</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Genetically Enhanced Plant Research Dome; 06:00–17:59</td><td data-label="Requirements">Known (25); after Forty Percent More</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">One Unapproved Seed</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Genetically Enhanced Plant Research Dome; 06:00–17:59</td><td data-label="Requirements">Acquaintance (50); after Genetic Reference</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">The Missing Half</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Genetically Enhanced Plant Research Dome; 06:00–17:59</td><td data-label="Requirements">Friend (100); after One Unapproved Seed</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">One Living Thing</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Genetically Enhanced Plant Research Dome; 06:00–17:59</td><td data-label="Requirements">Close Friend (200); after The Missing Half</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Beneath the Processing Zone</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Industrial Waste Processing Zone; 08:00–17:59</td><td data-label="Requirements">Crush (400); after One Living Thing</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">The Forest in the File</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Archive Facility; 08:00–19:59</td><td data-label="Requirements">Romantic (800); after Beneath the Processing Zone / archive record 6 / After the Survey</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">The First Unmeasured Plot</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Industrial Waste Processing Zone; 08:00–17:59</td><td data-label="Requirements">Intimate (1600); after The Forest in the File / Story 35; home from vacation: Terra / Ghost</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">What We Keep</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Genetically Enhanced Plant Research Dome; 06:00–17:59</td><td data-label="Requirements">In Love (3000); after The First Unmeasured Plot</td></tr></tbody></table><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Action</th><th scope="col">Requirements / start window</th><th scope="col">Cost / recovery</th><th scope="col">Reward / limit</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">The Seed She Named</th><td data-label="Requirements / start window">Friend (100); after One Unapproved Seed</td><td data-label="Cost / recovery">75 min; 15 Energy; restores 8 Calm</td><td data-label="Reward / limit">once</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Beauty Without a Metric</th><td data-label="Requirements / start window">Close Friend (200); after One Living Thing / The Seed She Named</td><td data-label="Cost / recovery">90 min; 20 Energy; restores 10 Calm</td><td data-label="Reward / limit">once</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">After the Survey</th><td data-label="Requirements / start window">Crush (400); after Beneath the Processing Zone / Beauty Without a Metric</td><td data-label="Cost / recovery">90 min; 20 Energy; restores 15 Calm</td><td data-label="Reward / limit">once</td></tr></tbody></table><p>After that visit, select Help Defend the Fortress at her ordinary portrait. It takes 0 minutes, completes Something Worth Defending and recruits her to the Army. This is a distinct action; completing the earlier visit alone does not recruit her.</p><p>At In Love (3,000), finish What We Keep, then select A Familiar Scent, 06:00–17:59. It takes 20 minutes and grants Memorymint Runners once for Willow’s medicine collection. Held or already-delivered ownership prevents a second gift.</p></section>
<section id="en-activities"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Ordinary_Actions_and_Lessons"></span><h2>Activities and rewards</h2><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Action</th><th scope="col">Requirements / start window</th><th scope="col">Cost / recovery</th><th scope="col">Reward / limit</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Help Defend the Fortress</th><td data-label="Requirements / start window">after The First Unmeasured Plot</td><td data-label="Cost / recovery">0 min</td><td data-label="Reward / limit">once</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Talk to Terra</th><td data-label="Requirements / start window">Stranger (0)</td><td data-label="Cost / recovery">15 min</td><td data-label="Reward / limit">+1 base affection; 3/day</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Give Flowers</th><td data-label="Requirements / start window">Known (25)</td><td data-label="Cost / recovery">10 min; 1 Flowers</td><td data-label="Reward / limit">+5 base affection; 5/day</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Living Substrates</th><td data-label="Requirements / start window">Known (25); Intelligence 19</td><td data-label="Cost / recovery">180 min; $200; 50 Energy; 25 Calm</td><td data-label="Reward / limit">+10 base affection; learn Material Science once</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Read Plant Stress</th><td data-label="Requirements / start window">Friend (100); Intelligence 35</td><td data-label="Cost / recovery">45 min; requires 12 Energy and 5 Calm available. Energy and Calm are not spent.</td><td data-label="Reward / limit">+8 direct affection; Perception +1; once</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Skygarden Date</th><td data-label="Requirements / start window">Crush (400); after After the Survey; 08:00–15:59</td><td data-label="Cost / recovery">120 min; $80; 30 Energy; restores 15 Calm</td><td data-label="Reward / limit">once</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Memory Arcade Date</th><td data-label="Requirements / start window">Crush (400); after Beneath the Processing Zone / After the Survey; 12:00–17:59</td><td data-label="Cost / recovery">120 min; $100; 35 Energy; restores 10 Calm</td><td data-label="Reward / limit">once</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">A Familiar Scent</th><td data-label="Requirements / start window">In Love (3000); after What We Keep; 06:00–17:59</td><td data-label="Cost / recovery">20 min</td><td data-label="Reward / limit">once</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Talk gives 1 base affection, three times per day. Flowers from Known (25) give 5, five gifts per day. Read Plant Stress needs Friend (100) and Intelligence 35 and gives Perception +1, once.</p><p>Both dates need the third conversation. The Memory Arcade date additionally needs the waste-site visit. They are optional for the personal automatic chain.</p><p>Favorite stats are Intelligence, Perception, Creativity. The learned Material Science skill improves her relationship bonus.</p><p>Start times are shown; the ending hour is excluded. Base affection receives the relationship bonuses, while direct affection is added as listed. Ordinary affection, player Erotic Experience and NPC intimacy experience are separate.</p></section>
<section id="en-troubleshooting"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Troubleshooting_and_Current_Scope"></span><h2>What usually blocks the next step</h2><ul><li>For the archive visit, complete both the third conversation and archive record 6; affection alone is insufficient.</li><li>For the waste-site continuation, check Story 35 and that both named characters have returned from vacation.</li><li>Army recruitment uses its own Help Defend the Fortress action after the qualifying visit.</li><li>The living gift needs In Love and What We Keep; it cannot be collected again after holding or delivering the specimen.</li></ul></section>
<section id="en-related"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Related_Pages"></span><h2>Related guides</h2><ul><li><a href="character-willow.html">Willow’s medicine specimens</a></li><li><a href="game-systems-td-army.html">Army recruitment</a></li><li><a href="game-systems-story-beats.html">Story progression</a></li><li><a href="game-systems-relationships-dating-and-intimacy.html">Relationships and dates</a></li></ul></section>
</div><div class="wiki-source-content wiki-source-content-zh" data-lang-panel="zh" hidden="" lang="zh-CN"><section id="zh-overview"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Overview"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Quick_Stats_and_Availability"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Recommended_Progression"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Heart-to-Heart_Requirements_and_Answers"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-The_Seed_She_Named"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Beauty_Without_a_Metric"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-After_the_Survey"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Optional_Higher-Point_Answers"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Optional_Dates"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Skygarden_Best_Replies"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Memory_Arcade_Best_Replies"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Help_Defend_the_Fortress"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-A_Familiar_Scent_and_Willow's_Medicine_Research"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-A_Familiar_Scent_and_Willow.27s_Medicine_Research"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Credits_and_Current_Scope"></span><h2>概览</h2><figure class="reviewed-screenshot" style="max-width: 256px"><a aria-label="查看完整截图：Terra 的角色头像。" href="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/terra.webp" rel="noopener" target="_blank"><img alt="Terra 的角色头像。" decoding="async" height="175" loading="lazy" src="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/terra.webp" width="175"/></a><figcaption>Terra 的角色头像。</figcaption></figure><p>Terra的路线由植物研究到访事件与三次交心对话交替推进，两次约会、军团邀请和一次活体礼物各有条件。</p></section>
<section id="zh-location"><h2>去哪里找</h2><p>她每天06:00—17:59在基因强化植物研究穹顶出现。后期部分自动事件从工业废料处理区或档案馆开始，详见表中地点。</p></section>
<section id="zh-route"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Automatic_Personal_Route"></span><h2>路线与关系进展</h2><p>初次到访进行非自然淘汰，再按下表推进。后期档案馆会面要求第三次交心对话调查之后，以及第6份档案记录完成。</p><p>第一块未测量样区要求主线35、亲密（1,600）、前一次档案馆会面，以及Terra和Ghost都已结束度假，不必先达到恋爱中。</p><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">自动事件</th><th scope="col">地点／开始时段</th><th scope="col">条件</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">非自然淘汰</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">基因强化植物研究穹顶；06:00–17:59</td><td data-label="条件"></td></tr><tr><th scope="row">产量增加四成</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">基因强化植物研究穹顶；06:00–17:59</td><td data-label="条件">已遇见（10）；完成：非自然淘汰</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">遗传参考材料</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">基因强化植物研究穹顶；06:00–17:59</td><td data-label="条件">已知（25）；完成：产量增加四成</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">一粒未批准的种子</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">基因强化植物研究穹顶；06:00–17:59</td><td data-label="条件">相识（50）；完成：遗传参考材料</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">缺少的那一半</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">基因强化植物研究穹顶；06:00–17:59</td><td data-label="条件">朋友（100）；完成：一粒未批准的种子</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">一个活生生的生命</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">基因强化植物研究穹顶；06:00–17:59</td><td data-label="条件">亲密朋友（200）；完成：缺少的那一半</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">处理区的地底</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">工业废料处理区；08:00–17:59</td><td data-label="条件">迷恋（400）；完成：一个活生生的生命</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">档案里的森林</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">档案设施；08:00–19:59</td><td data-label="条件">浪漫感（800）；完成：处理区的地底、第6份档案记录、调查之后</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">第一块未测量样区</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">工业废料处理区；08:00–17:59</td><td data-label="条件">亲密（1600）；完成：档案里的森林、主线35；已结束度假：Terra / Ghost</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">我们留下的事物</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">基因强化植物研究穹顶；06:00–17:59</td><td data-label="条件">恋爱中（3000）；完成：第一块未测量样区</td></tr></tbody></table><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">行动</th><th scope="col">条件／开始时段</th><th scope="col">消耗／恢复</th><th scope="col">奖励／次数</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">她命名的种子</th><td data-label="条件／开始时段">朋友（100）；完成：一粒未批准的种子</td><td data-label="消耗／恢复">75分钟；15精力；恢复8镇定</td><td data-label="奖励／次数">仅一次</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">没有指标的美</th><td data-label="条件／开始时段">亲密朋友（200）；完成：一个活生生的生命、她命名的种子</td><td data-label="消耗／恢复">90分钟；20精力；恢复10镇定</td><td data-label="奖励／次数">仅一次</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">调查之后</th><td data-label="条件／开始时段">迷恋（400）；完成：处理区的地底、没有指标的美</td><td data-label="消耗／恢复">90分钟；20精力；恢复15镇定</td><td data-label="奖励／次数">仅一次</td></tr></tbody></table><p>完成该次会面后，在普通头像选择协助保卫要塞，不消耗时间，完成值得守护的事物并招募她加入军团。招募是独立行动，前面的会面不会直接完成招募。</p><p>恋爱中（3,000）后完成我们留下的事物，再于06:00—17:59选择熟悉的香气，花费20分钟，一次性获得忆薄荷匍匐茎，可交给Willow作为药用标本。持有或已经交付后，不会再赠送第二份。</p></section>
<section id="zh-activities"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Ordinary_Actions_and_Lessons"></span><h2>行动与奖励</h2><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">行动</th><th scope="col">条件／开始时段</th><th scope="col">消耗／恢复</th><th scope="col">奖励／次数</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">协助保卫要塞</th><td data-label="条件／开始时段">完成：第一块未测量样区</td><td data-label="消耗／恢复">0分钟</td><td data-label="奖励／次数">仅一次</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">与 Terra 交谈</th><td data-label="条件／开始时段">陌生人（0）</td><td data-label="消耗／恢复">15分钟</td><td data-label="奖励／次数">基础好感+1；每天3次</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">送花</th><td data-label="条件／开始时段">已知（25）</td><td data-label="消耗／恢复">10分钟；鲜花×1</td><td data-label="奖励／次数">基础好感+5；每天5次</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">生命基质</th><td data-label="条件／开始时段">已知（25）；智力19</td><td data-label="消耗／恢复">180分钟；$200；50精力；25镇定</td><td data-label="奖励／次数">基础好感+10；学习材料科学，仅一次</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">判读植物压力</th><td data-label="条件／开始时段">朋友（100）；智力35</td><td data-label="消耗／恢复">45分钟；开始时需有12精力、5镇定，两者均不扣除。</td><td data-label="奖励／次数">直接好感+8；感知+1；仅一次</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">空中花园约会</th><td data-label="条件／开始时段">迷恋（400）；完成：调查之后；08:00–15:59</td><td data-label="消耗／恢复">120分钟；$80；30精力；恢复15镇定</td><td data-label="奖励／次数">仅一次</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">记忆游戏厅约会</th><td data-label="条件／开始时段">迷恋（400）；完成：处理区的地底、调查之后；12:00–17:59</td><td data-label="消耗／恢复">120分钟；$100；35精力；恢复10镇定</td><td data-label="奖励／次数">仅一次</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">熟悉的香气</th><td data-label="条件／开始时段">恋爱中（3000）；完成：我们留下的事物；06:00–17:59</td><td data-label="消耗／恢复">20分钟</td><td data-label="奖励／次数">仅一次</td></tr></tbody></table><p>交谈给予1基础好感，每天三次；已知（25）后送花给予5，每天五次。判读植物压力要求朋友（100）和智力35，一次性给予感知+1。</p><p>两次约会都要求第三次交心对话，记忆游戏厅约会还需工业废料处理区会面；都不是个人自动事件链的必经步骤。</p><p>偏好的属性为智力、感知、创造力。学会材料科学可提高关系加成。</p><p>表中均为开始时间，不包含结束整点。基础好感受关系加成影响，直接好感按所列数值增加。普通好感、玩家情趣经验和NPC亲密经验分别计算。</p></section>
<section id="zh-troubleshooting"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Troubleshooting_and_Current_Scope"></span><h2>卡住时检查什么</h2><ul><li>档案馆会面需第三次交心对话和第6份档案记录，只有好感不够。</li><li>工业废料处理区后续需主线35，两名角色都要结束度假。</li><li>招募需在对应会面之后，另行选择协助保卫要塞。</li><li>活体礼物需恋爱中和我们留下的事物；持有或交付标本后不能重领。</li></ul></section>
